=== ABOUT information panel
|                                 About Widgets                                  |
|                                                                                |
| What a widget is                                                               |
|                                                                                |
| A widget is an object of the library it lives in. Its text, kind, owner and    |
| quantity are shown by the display panel and changed by the change panel.       |
|                                                                                |
| Press F12 to go back to the menu.                                              |
|                                                                                |
|                                                                                |
|                                                                                |
|                                                                                |
|                                                                                |
|                                                                                |
|                                                                                |
|                                                                                |
|                                                                                |
|                                                                                |
| Fixed text under the information area.                                         |
|                                                                                |
| Press Enter to go back.                                                        |
|                                                                                |
| F3=Exit   F12=Cancel                                                           |
| Copyright (C) 2026 Quartz Systems                                              |
